110338786660845_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S8JW0lg6MhoQ7kNvwE7r6iB&_nc_oc=AdmzcAlKqkwdj1DDkYLdyWRnNFb6wXvTxnKwnDpB_Ik0FwdvRN81daQJknQq3bZW0Lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvwH7Hnjgbyy45Larl4GksWvtOJ86ZD4zFFjkebuaBZqg&oe=69985787"}, {"file_name": "1000017016.png", "id": "1020510112794458", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392016_1020510116127791_1096840343013264339_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wUnjnEa5rbcQ7kNvwHXV8k5&_nc_oc=AdlWMPDz6RXAaPeiSAcpQVG1OIfNNdM3yv-wZtmlgsv0TP4n3cZRJtNlzTr4Bohd5Hs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsnzVHn56O82eXIIicOcmNWpNEXzNtJiIuIAj1i_cQFTw&oe=69984464"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "284612080076581", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974910_284612083409914_181064660682537571_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pb_SOeustg4Q7kNvwHVSiRo&_nc_oc=Adm3uLVruBvYgwoNzW7HYGF74rQhCShUreFOCXZLcHE0LnpSrUWZv2C8dS_U4ilrhHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu9Y12H-9tG8gZTuLqFYJ1B5McNvBkYO-541k2MABH9ww&oe=69983CF4"}, "display_name": "Wack-Ammo", "keywords": ["shooting", "mole", "reflex", "arena", "trophy"], "long_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR.\n\n* 9 Unique Levels \n* Different Guns & Wackers Each Gallery\n* Unlock Badges For Your \"Wall Of Achievement\" With Each Victory\n*Earned Trophies Come To Life In Your Home Gallery\n\nWack-Ammo is a must play for every Quest owner.", "short_descripti